{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2025-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1745366400, "end_date": 1746057599, "month_true_total": 86, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:01:31 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "193920950", "author": {"steamid": "76561198016730900", "personaname": "Chuggles", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/McChuggles/", "num_games_owned": 1112, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 4835, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4835, "deck_playtime_at_review": 4822, "last_played": 1745998603, "avatar": "65a8837319c24942a52c7ed3d892bf831763de1c"}, "language": "english", "review": "When's Andromeda 2", "timestamp_created": 1746036390, "timestamp_updated": 1746036390, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.490978151559829712", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193913173", "author": {"steamid": "76561198182941353", "personaname": "eras", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198182941353/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 7259, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7259, "last_played": 1747085344, "avatar": "82117d946b2d9a89ab65a13cb2836d39de148c90"}, "language": "english", "review": "I am amazed  by this game. The only downside is that the options you pick in dialogues, don't have impact into the story. I would like to, because some decisions are on moral-grey zone. 120 hours to finish the game. I reccommend it 9/10. I will try the newest, too, and i will edit this review. I liked that the multiplayer still functions and you can meet pros and noobs in them.", "timestamp_created": 1746028616, "timestamp_updated": 1747085400, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193870644", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025754096", "personaname": "jammasterjoke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198025754096/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 10799, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3178, "last_played": 1751145044, "avatar": "48db6bc3ad5c71b92c6e0ebb689b54915cfa70b2"}, "language": "english", "review": "a mediocre game that forces you to use a much worse launcher and continually re-login. do no buy games from ea. half the selling points are wildly embellished or outright lies. the people who made this game didn't know if they were trying to make a platformer, shooter, rpg, settlement and crafting game or sudoku simulator.", "timestamp_created": 1745965957, "timestamp_updated": 1746080675, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494410783052444458", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193849623", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989329284", "personaname": "Persmo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197989329284/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 872, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 872, "last_played": 1745942150, "avatar": "e1a9ed77ca97f4eb849d4c9d6cd507400296e8ea"}, "language": "english", "review": "Like many others have said the story, characters and a bunch of mechnics are just watered-down from the real Mass Effects games. If it were just that I wouldn't have left a bad review since I got the game for 3,99€. But!\n\nApart from that the game is still a steaming hot piece of buggy mess. I bought and played it on launch before and somehow my experience was LESS buggy then than it is now playing it on Steam now. Everything from character models looking like they've been tranquilized to mobs just spawning out of nowhere and the menus being super slow etc etc. I had none of this ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ when i played the game in 2017 on EA:s Origin. Don't know what happened when it got to Steam.\n\nI wouldn't not recommend this game even if there's a sale. Save you sanity.", "timestamp_created": 1745942959, "timestamp_updated": 1745942959, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492383986711502075", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193804287", "author": {"steamid": "76561198147359391", "personaname": "MAX KEEBLE", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tkneptune/", "num_games_owned": 192, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 5974, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5974, "last_played": 1745879125, "avatar": "d4f96ff3e1c2e11ad75ec35860f17313957df776"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game and story. More similar to ME1 than ME2 and ME3. It doesn't deserve its bad reputation at all. It has a few bugs but there are easy workarounds. Solid 3.8/5 game I'd say", "timestamp_created": 1745879365, "timestamp_updated": 1745879365, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497366875410079956", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, 